          Klien Kami
        </h3>
        <h2
          class="text-3xl leading-tight font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-5xl dark:text-white"
        >
          Kolaborasi & <span class="text-blue-500">Kepercayaan</span> Lintas Sektor.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Description and bulleted Stat count -->
